20. The Steering Committee had representatives from the various Central Ministries

/ Departments, Registrar General of India, State Governments, Reserve Bank of India and
Federation of Indian Chambers of Commerce & Industry etc.

21. The Steering Committee, after having considered the issues involved in the revision of
NIC 1987 decided on the broad framework for undertaking the revision. The following two

principles were laid down by the Committee: -

(a) To follow ISIC-1990 codes (alongwith nomenclature) in toto and extend them to 5-digit

