This division includes the manufacture of wood products, such as lumber, plywood, veneers, wood containers,
wood flooring, wood trusses, and prefabricated wood buildings. The production processes include sawing,
planning, shaping, laminating, and assembling of wood products starting from logs that are cut into bolts,
