for motor vehicles and motorcycles. Also included are activities of commission agents involved in wholesale
or retail sale of vehicles.

This division also includes activities such as washing, polishing of vehicles etc.

This division does not include the retail sale of automotive fuel and lubricating or cooling products or the
renting of motor vehicles or motorcycles.

